Oh no, I certainly agree that keywords is not enough for proper learning of
Lojban valsi. I just also happen to think that the full and complete
definitions are a bit overkill for nintadni. The very complexities may even
cause some to give the idea of learning pause. When I created these
simplified definitions, which I did originally mostly because of character
limits placed by Smart.fm, the learning website I was making the lessons
for, I did so with a mind to preserve the definition in its whole whilst
cutting out the more complex parts of the full definition.

